      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy asks for “While Using” only, never “Always”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy prosi tylko o „Podczas używania”, nigdy o „Zawsze”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy calls you": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy dzwoni do Ciebie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy can only find what you told it. It can't see your home or track your things.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy znajdzie tylko to, co mu powiedziałeś. Nie widzi Twojego domu i nie śledzi Twoich rzeczy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy can use these only when you say so. Each one starts off. Nothing is added, started, sent or opened until you tap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy może z nich korzystać tylko, gdy mu pozwolisz. Każde jest na początku wyłączone. Nic nie zostanie dodane, uruchomione, wysłane ani otwarte, dopóki nie stukniesz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy can't use that address. Use a public web address (https://…).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy nie może użyć tego adresu. Użyj publicznego adresu internetowego (https://…)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy checks your open reminders on this iPhone first, so it isn't added twice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy checks your open reminders on this iPad first, so it isn't added twice."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy checks your open reminders on this iPhone first, so it isn't added twice."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy najpierw sprawdza otwarte przypomnienia na tym iPadzie, żeby nie dodać go dwa razy."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy najpierw sprawdza otwarte przypomnienia na tym iPhonie, żeby nie dodać go dwa razy."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy couldn't keep a copy of this unfinished note on this iPhone (%@). Save it before you leave.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy couldn't keep a copy of this unfinished note on this iPad (%@). Save it before you leave."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy couldn't keep a copy of this unfinished note on this iPhone (%@). Save it before you leave."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy nie zdołał zachować kopii tej niedokończonej notatki na tym iPadzie (%@). Zapisz ją, zanim wyjdziesz."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy nie zdołał zachować kopii tej niedokończonej notatki na tym iPhonie (%@). Zapisz ją, zanim wyjdziesz."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPhone, never sent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPad, never sent."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPhone, never sent."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy liczy, jak często cofasz zmianę, poprawiasz krok, mówisz „To nieprawda”, prosisz o to samo jeszcze raz albo zostawiasz propozycję bez odpowiedzi, żeby można było zobaczyć, czy robi postępy. Zapisywany jest tylko rodzaj zdarzenia i nazwa narzędzia, przez 90 dni, na tym iPadzie, i nigdy nie jest to wysyłane."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy liczy, jak często cofasz zmianę, poprawiasz krok, mówisz „To nieprawda”, prosisz o to samo jeszcze raz albo zostawiasz propozycję bez odpowiedzi, żeby można było zobaczyć, czy robi postępy. Zapisywany jest tylko rodzaj zdarzenia i nazwa narzędzia, przez 90 dni, na tym iPhonie, i nigdy nie jest to wysyłane."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy doesn't speak to anyone here. Use it for a guide, a talk or an announcement, not someone's private conversation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy nie mówi tu do nikogo. Używaj tego do przewodnika, wykładu albo komunikatu, nie do czyjejś prywatnej rozmowy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy doesn't use these until you say they are.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy nie korzysta z tego, dopóki nie potwierdzisz, że to wciąż prawda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy during this Focus": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy w tym trybie skupienia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy follows you if you switch language while you talk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy dopasuje się, jeśli zmienisz język w trakcie rozmowy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy has no place on this iPhone to keep unfinished notes. Save this one before you leave.": {
