    },
    "Doddy is an AI, not a person. Your question, the last few messages and any notes shown under an answer are sent to Doddy's server and on to OpenAI to write the reply. Nothing is saved unless you save it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy to SI, nie człowiek. Twoje pytanie, kilka ostatnich wiadomości i notatki pokazane pod odpowiedzią trafiają na serwer Doddy’ego i dalej do OpenAI, aby napisać odpowiedź. Nic nie jest zapisywane, dopóki sam tego nie zapiszesz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy is locked": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy jest zablokowany"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy is speaking": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy mówi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy is thinking…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy myśli…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy is using only your notes: no calendar, reminders, contacts, other apps or online accounts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy korzysta tylko z Twoich notatek: bez kalendarza, przypomnień, kontaktów, innych aplikacji i kont online."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy last heard you say": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ostatnie, co Doddy usłyszał"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy looks through what you told it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy przegląda to, co mu powiedziałeś."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy may call me": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy może do mnie dzwonić"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy needs permission to remind you": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy potrzebuje pozwolenia, żeby Ci przypominać"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy needs two permissions for this": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy potrzebuje do tego dwóch pozwoleń"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy needs your location while you use the app to remind you at a place. Nothing was set. Allow it in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy potrzebuje Twojej lokalizacji podczas używania aplikacji, żeby przypomnieć Ci w danym miejscu. Nic nie zostało ustawione. Zezwól na to w Ustawieniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy noticed this in what you said. It stays on this iPhone. It is handed to Doddy in a conversation only if you turned that on in Settings, What I've learned.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy noticed this in what you said. It stays on this iPad. It is handed to Doddy in a conversation only if you turned that on in Settings, What I've learned."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy noticed this in what you said. It stays on this iPhone. It is handed to Doddy in a conversation only if you turned that on in Settings, What I've learned."
                }
              }
            }
          }
