    "Doddy says his suggestion to them, in their language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy powie im swoją propozycję w ich języku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy stops reading your calendar right away and asks Google to remove its access. Memories you saved yourself stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy od razu przestaje czytać Twój kalendarz i prosi Google o usunięcie dostępu. Wspomnienia zapisane przez Ciebie zostają."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy translates between you and someone who speaks another language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy tłumaczy między Tobą a kimś, kto mówi w innym języku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy was asking to save this": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy pytał, czy to zapisać"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy wrote these down during calls. They become memories only when you save them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy zanotował to podczas rozmów. Staną się wspomnieniami dopiero, gdy je zapiszesz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy's alarms ring even in Silent mode or a Focus. Only alarms set by Doddy are shown here; the Clock app's alarms aren't.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
