            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jak blisko, w metrach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the island looks while you talk to Doddy from another app. These are previews, not a running conversation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jak wygląda wyspa, gdy rozmawiasz z Doddym z innej aplikacji. To podglądy, a nie trwająca rozmowa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Humour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Humor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I haven't\nfound that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie znalazłem\ntego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I ran it another way": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uruchomiłem to inaczej"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I won't fill in the gaps. Try a distinctive word from the note.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie będę zgadywać. Spróbuj charakterystycznego słowa z notatki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it repeats, only this time changes. Nothing is deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeśli się powtarza, zmieni się tylko ten raz. Nic nie zostanie usunięte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it repeats, only this time is deleted. This can't be undone from Doddy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeśli się powtarza, usunięte zostanie tylko to jedno. Doddy nie może tego cofnąć."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your iPhone doesn't list it under Back Tap": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeśli Twój iPhone nie pokazuje tego w Stuknięciu w tył"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import from Google Keep or text files": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importuj z Google Keep lub plików tekstowych"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import notes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importuj notatki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported from a file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaimportowano z pliku"
          }
