    "Imported, date unknown": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaimportowano, data nieznana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In 1 hour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za godzinę"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a conversation, ask for one by name and Doddy shows one card with these steps. Every step still needs your tap, every time. A routine you don't use for 90 days is taken off below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W rozmowie poproś o rutynę po nazwie, a Doddy pokaże jedną kartę z tymi krokami. Każdy krok nadal wymaga Twojego dotknięcia, za każdym razem. Rutyna nieużywana przez 90 dni trafia niżej, do wyłączonych."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In progress": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W toku"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include photos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dołącz zdjęcia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include voice memos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dołącz notatki głosowe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intention": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zamiar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It couldn't be written out. The recording is still here; type a few words so you can find the note later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się zapisać tego jako tekst. Nagranie wciąż tu jest; wpisz kilka słów, żeby łatwo znaleźć notatkę później."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn't work, show me the steps": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie zadziałało, pokaż mi kroki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It hasn't been saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie została zapisana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It hasn't been saved. Keep it for later and it opens the next time you start a new note; a photo or recording isn't kept with it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie została zapisana. Zachowaj ją na później, a otworzy się, gdy następnym razem zaczniesz nową notatkę; zdjęcie ani nagranie nie są z nią zachowywane."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from this iPhone and from what Doddy can use. This can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPad and from what Doddy can use. This can't be undone."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPhone and from what Doddy can use. This can't be undone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięte z tego iPada i z tego, z czego może korzystać Doddy. Tego nie można cofnąć."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięte z tego iPhone’a i z tego, z czego może korzystać Doddy. Tego nie można cofnąć."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from this iPhone and won't be brought up again. Notes you saved during it stay, and the voice provider (OpenAI or ElevenLabs) may keep its own record as described in Settings › Privacy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPad and won't be brought up again. Notes you saved during it stay, and the voice provider (OpenAI or ElevenLabs) may keep its own record as described in Settings › Privacy."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPhone and won't be brought up again. Notes you saved during it stay, and the voice provider (OpenAI or ElevenLabs) may keep its own record as described in Settings › Privacy."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięta z tego iPada i nie będzie już przywoływana. Notatki zapisane podczas niej zostają, a dostawca głosu (OpenAI lub ElevenLabs) może przechowywać własny zapis, jak opisano w Ustawieniach › Prywatność."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięta z tego iPhone’a i nie będzie już przywoływana. Notatki zapisane podczas niej zostają, a dostawca głosu (OpenAI lub ElevenLabs) może przechowywać własny zapis, jak opisano w Ustawieniach › Prywatność."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from this iPhone. Anything it already did stays as it is.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPad. Anything it already did stays as it is."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It is removed from this iPhone. Anything it already did stays as it is."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięta z tego iPada. To, co już zrobiła, pozostaje bez zmian."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Zostanie usunięta z tego iPhone’a. To, co już zrobiła, pozostaje bez zmian."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may not have gone back. Check it in Calendar or Reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mogło nie wrócić do poprzedniego stanu. Sprawdź to w Kalendarzu lub Przypomnieniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It rings even in Silent mode or a Focus, with Snooze for 9 minutes. Turn it off in Settings, Alarms, or ask Doddy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zadzwoni nawet w trybie cichym i przy włączonym skupieniu, z drzemką na 9 minut. Wyłączysz go w Ustawieniach, w sekcji Budziki, albo prosząc Doddy’ego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was changed elsewhere since, so Doddy left it alone. Check it in Calendar or Reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W międzyczasie zmieniono to gdzie indziej, więc Doddy tego nie ruszał. Sprawdź to w Kalendarzu lub Przypomnieniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was in Keep's trash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Była w koszu Keep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was long, so only the first part was added.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Było długie, więc dodano tylko pierwszą część."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was never saved, so it can't be brought back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nigdy nie została zapisana, więc nie da się jej przywrócić."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's too late to undo here. Change it in Calendar or Reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na cofnięcie tutaj jest już za późno. Zmień to w Kalendarzu lub Przypomnieniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rzecz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pozycje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its items show on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island until every item is ticked or you end it, so anyone who sees your iPhone can read them. Ticking there ticks here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jej pozycje są widoczne na ekranie blokady i w Dynamic Island, dopóki nie odhaczysz wszystkich albo nie zakończysz trybu, więc każdy, kto widzi Twojego iPhone’a, może je przeczytać. Odhaczenie tam odhacza też tutaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its photo or recording wasn't kept with it. Add it again if you need it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jej zdjęcie lub nagranie nie zostało zachowane. Dodaj je ponownie, jeśli go potrzebujesz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its words were added below, written out on this iPhone. Speech-to-text makes mistakes, so check it before saving.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Its words were added below, written out on this iPad. Speech-to-text makes mistakes, so check it before saving."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Its words were added below, written out on this iPhone. Speech-to-text makes mistakes, so check it before saving."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Słowa zostały dodane poniżej, zapisane jako tekst na tym iPadzie. Zamiana mowy na tekst popełnia błędy, więc sprawdź je przed zapisaniem."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Słowa zostały dodane poniżej, zapisane jako tekst na tym iPhonie. Zamiana mowy na tekst popełnia błędy, więc sprawdź je przed zapisaniem."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join list": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dołącz do listy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joining adds this list to Doddy on this iPhone. Its items, and the changes anyone makes, go through iCloud to everyone who shares it. Your notes and other lists aren't shared.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Joining adds this list to Doddy on this iPad. Its items, and the changes anyone makes, go through iCloud to everyone who shares it. Your notes and other lists aren't shared."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Joining adds this list to Doddy on this iPhone. Its items, and the changes anyone makes, go through iCloud to everyone who shares it. Your notes and other lists aren't shared."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
